TASK: Assess whether weight quantization or KV cache quantization is the better lever for fitting a larger model on one accelerator without losing accuracy. Use the published results and the measured series, and say which evidence decides it.
ROUNDS: 2
SUMMARY: The research task is to assess whether weight quantization or KV cache quantization is the better approach for fitting a larger model on one accelerator without losing accuracy. The sources of information include published results and measured series.

The web-search agent did not provide any findings.

The paper-search agent found relevant papers with the query "weight quantization KV cache quantization model accuracy accelerator".

The data-analysis agent provided a metric series for model accuracy related to weight quantization.

The fact-check agent did not provide any findings.

The sources agree that both weight quantization and KV cache quantization can impact model accuracy when fitting larger models on one accelerator. The data-analysis agent's metric series on model accuracy for weight quantization can be used to compare the effectiveness of the two methods. However, more specific data on KV cache quantization is needed to make a definitive conclusion.
REPORT: ResearchReport(title='Comparison of Weight Quantization and KV Cache Quantization for Fitting Larger Models on One Accelerator', mainText="The research task is to assess whether weight quantization or KV cache quantization is the better approach for fitting a larger model on one accelerator without losing accuracy. The sources of information include published results and measured series. The web-search agent did not provide any findings. The paper-search agent found relevant papers with the query 'weight quantization KV cache quantization model accuracy accelerator'. The data-analysis agent provided a metric series for model accuracy related to weight quantization. The fact-check agent did not provide any findings. The sources agree that both weight quantization and KV cache quantization can impact model accuracy when fitting larger models on one accelerator. The data-analysis agent's metric series on model accuracy for weight quantization can be used to compare the effectiveness of the two methods. However, more specific data on KV cache quantization is needed to make a definitive conclusion.", tldr=['The research indicates that both weight quantization and KV cache quantization can affect model accuracy when fitting larger models on one accelerator. While there is data available for weight quantization, more specific data on KV cache quantization is required to draw a definitive conclusion.'])
